<p id="_8229882e-d7d5-6860-dd02-0661c33d16df">i-UR Data Encoding Specification of i-Urban Revitalization -Urban Planning ADE-</p>

<p id="_f435b068-5ddc-ab2f-ed6a-22f7882dc6d9">JPGIS Japan Profile of Geographic Information Standards</p>

<p id="_12d0d8d3-5b6e-b0ac-2360-b33b68458aa1">LOD Level Of Detail</p>

