<title>14)　IfcBuildingElement_predefinedType.xml</title>
<table id="_bfb8c9a1-db00-ea86-22cc-a00e1acd2e44"><colgroup><col width="12%"/><col width="88%"/></colgroup><thead><tr><th valign="top" align="left">ファイル名</th>
