<clause id="_20ifcstairtypeenum" obligation="normative">
<title>20)　IfcStairTypeEnum</title>
<table id="_8d1194be-d6bf-b48c-c70f-bf2244fa3edc"><colgroup><col width="12%"/><col width="88%"/></colgroup><thead><tr><th valign="top" align="left">列挙型</th>
<th valign="top" align="left">IfcStairTypeEnum</th>
</tr></thead>
<tbody><tr><td valign="top" align="left">値</td>
<td valign="top" align="left">説明</td>
</tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left">STRAIGHTRUNSTAIR</td>
<td valign="top" align="left">直線的な階段</td>
</tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left">TWOSTRAIGHTRUNSTAIR</td>
<td valign="top" align="left">踊り場が1ヵ所設けられた直線的な階段</td>
