</tr><tr><td valign="top" align="center"><figure id="_ae919d06-4a76-ed64-11de-53a68ccc9811" width="140"><image src="data:image/png;base64," mimetype="image/png" id="_fd29c183-b39a-1840-0dd2-e5ac7764513f" height="auto" width="140" alt=""/></figure>
