<td valign="top" align="center"><figure id="_9fc4a2da-cfe9-45e2-a969-80e685b2d5d3" width="210"><image src="data:image/png;base64," mimetype="image/png" id="_574e8243-abcf-d0fc-2ac5-7349e0caa9f8" height="auto" width="210" alt=""/></figure>
