<td valign="top" align="center">LOD1</td>
<td valign="top" align="center">LOD2</td>
<td valign="top" align="center">LOD3</td>
<td valign="top" align="left">適用</td>
</tr><tr><td valign="top" rowspan="6" align="left">tran:Road</td>
<td valign="top" align="left"/><td valign="top" align="center">●</td>
<td valign="top" align="center">●</td>
<td valign="top" align="center">●</td>
<td valign="top" align="center">●</td>
<td valign="top" align="left"/></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left">tran:lod0Network</td>
<td valign="top" align="center">■</td>
<td valign="top" align="left"/><td valign="top" align="left"/><td valign="top" align="left"/><td valign="top" rowspan="2" align="left">LOD0はネットワークを原則とするが、数値地形図との互換性を保つために、道路縁を選択できる。</td>
</tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left">uro:lod0Geometry</td>
<td valign="top" align="center">■</td>
<td valign="top" align="left"/><td valign="top" align="left"/><td valign="top" align="left"/></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left">tran:lod1MultiSurface</td>
<td valign="top" align="left"/><td valign="top" align="center">●</td>
<td valign="top" align="left"/><td valign="top" align="left"/><td valign="top" align="left"/></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left">tran:lod2MultiSurface</td>
<td valign="top" align="center"/><td valign="top" align="left"/><td valign="top" align="center">●</td>
<td valign="top" align="left"/><td valign="top" align="left"/></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left">tran:lod3MultiSurface</td>
<td valign="top" align="center"/><td valign="top" align="left"/><td valign="top" align="left"/><td valign="top" align="center">●</td>
