<clause id="_24_urftreeplantingdistrict" obligation="normative">
<title>24) urf:TreePlantingDistrict</title>
<table id="_04fa343e-6ac1-4eeb-ea80-f1734fa22028"><colgroup><col width="25%"/><col width="25%"/><col width="50%"/></colgroup><tbody><tr><td valign="top" align="left">型の定義</td>
