<clause id="_1urfurbandevelopmentproject" obligation="normative">
<title>1)　urf:UrbanDevelopmentProject</title>
<table id="_165e5a7b-93bc-a3bd-933d-94ed260944ad"><colgroup><col width="25%"/><col width="25%"/><col width="50%"/></colgroup><thead><tr><th valign="top" align="left">型の定義</th>
<th colspan="2" valign="top" align="left">都市計画法第12条に定める市街地開発事業</th>
</tr></thead>
<tbody><tr><td valign="top" align="left">上位の型</td>
<td colspan="2" valign="top" align="left">urf:Zone</td>
</tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left">ステレオタイプ</td>
<td colspan="2" valign="top" align="left">&lt;&lt; FeatureType &gt;&gt;</td>
</tr><tr><td colspan="3" valign="top" align="left">継承する属性</td>
</tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left">属性名</td>
