<clause id="_11bridinteriorwallsurface" obligation="normative">
<title>11)　brid:InteriorWallSurface</title>
<table id="_0d8205ee-92de-7d94-6dc5-55bfc9424ea4"><colgroup><col width="25%"/><col width="25%"/><col width="50%"/></colgroup><thead><tr><th valign="top" align="left">型の定義</th>
<th colspan="2" valign="top" align="left">橋梁の内部空間の区画を区切る壁や仕切り。</th>
