<clause id="toc4_12_02" obligation="normative">
<title>　トンネルモデルの応用スキーマクラス図</title>
<clause id="toc4_12_02_01" obligation="normative">
<title>(1) Tunnel（CityGML）</title>
<figure id="_b6d0afd6-8ae6-a9c6-6e69-d8ae87d7ebe1"><image src="images/267.svg" mimetype="image/svg+xml" id="_a0875845-b0de-8246-8c4b-e2883f665b27" height="auto" width="auto"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" version="1.1" id="__x30ec___x30a4___x30e4___x30fc__1_inject_50" x="0px" y="0px" viewBox="0 0 1067.9 1185.9" style="enable-background:new 0 0 1067.9 1185.9;" xml:space="preserve">
<style type="text/css">
	.st0_inject_44 {fill-rule:evenodd;clip-rule:evenodd;fill:#CFD1D8;}
