<clause id="_17uroelevation" obligation="normative">
<title>17)　uro:Elevation</title>
<table id="_dcae2fdc-8bb9-620e-782d-b3122c618f0b"><colgroup><col width="25%"/><col width="25%"/><col width="50%"/></colgroup><thead><tr><th valign="top" align="left">型の定義</th>
