<clause id="_10uroappurtenance" obligation="normative">
<title>10)　uro:Appurtenance</title>
<table id="_fad22dcf-049b-4855-e9c7-6ce3143e5266"><tbody><tr><td valign="top" align="left">型の定義</td>
